# Release contains approved product only

## Rule
- **MUST:** Use the project-root `release/` for approved, ready-to-consume products.
- **MUST NOT:** Copy scratch directories, tool caches, compilation intermediates, QA reports or promotion logs into `release/`.
- **MAY:** Include required runtime dependencies, manifests, license notices and user/product documentation when they are part of the deliverable.
- **MUST:** Make each released product identifiable and reproducible from its approved baseline and controlled dependencies.
- **MUST:** Keep QA and promotion traces outside `release/`; their existence or retention is defined by the relevant workflow.
